sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor IO as Investigating Officer
    participant Assistant as TarkaUniversalAssistant (UI)
    participant Sec as Security Firewall & Prompt Sanitizer
    participant Router as Intent & Context Router
    participant Spec as Specialist Forensic Agents
    participant DNA as Evidence DNA / FCC Registry
    participant WORM as Flight Recorder (Audit Log)

    IO->>Assistant: Submit Query (Voice / Text in Hindi/Tamil/English/etc.)
    Assistant->>Sec: Pre-filter input (Strip instruction escapes)
    Sec->>Router: Sanitized Query + Active View Context (e.g., LIBR)
    Router->>Spec: Dispatch query to specialist agents (Financial / Graph / Telecom)
    Spec->>DNA: Fetch verified facts by SHA-256 hash
    DNA-->>Spec: Grounded observations & contradictions
    Spec-->>Router: Synthesized forensic findings
    Router->>DNA: Verify all citations are authenticated
    DNA-->>Router: Citation verification passed
    opt High-Risk Action Detected (e.g., Freeze Account / Subpoena)
        Router->>Assistant: Trigger Human Confirmation Dialog
        Assistant->>IO: Prompt for IO PIN & Statutory Authority
        IO->>Assistant: Authenticate with Officer Signature
    end
    Router->>WORM: Log interaction, model prompt, citations & action
    Router-->>Assistant: Render structured response (Facts, Inferences, Citations)
    Assistant-->>IO: Display Skeuomorphic Answer with Clickable Badges

